# .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Skip large code-movement commits in `git blame` so the output points at the
# original author instead of an intermediate refactor.
#
# Local setup (one-time):
#   git config --local blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#   # or simply:  make blame-ignore
#
# GitHub's web UI reads this file automatically once it exists on the default
# branch — no per-user configuration needed there.
#
# Convention: oldest-first. Append new entries at the bottom.

